WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
A silver ribbon forms the Stillforce S against a dark background.

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.300
“Sign in once.” The Stillforce sign-in panel offers a GeForce NOW provider and a sign-in button.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.450
“Hover to preview.” The cover wall sits beside artwork for Control Ultimate Edition, No Man’s Sky and Cyberpunk 2077.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.850
“Search. Filter.” The All games menu opens. Stardew Valley appears in the featured panel.

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.200
“Browse with keys.” Arrow keys and Enter appear below the moving cover wall.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.800
“Press play.” The GeForce NOW session screen reads “Connecting to your game.”

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.150
“F3 for the numbers.” The statistics overlay shows frame rate, latency and packet loss.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.550
“Make it yours.” The Appearance settings show theme options and a row of accent colours.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:25.000
The silver S returns above “Stillforce” and “GeForce NOW for Windows.” The closing card reads “Get it on GitHub.”
